{"product_id":"full-life-with-diabetes","title":"Full Life With Diabetes","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe revised fifth edition of Full Life with Diabetes answers common queries and clears misconceptions about the disease. The understanding of the basic mechanisms leading to diabetes has vastly improved and led to new treatment options. This book provides current information on these options. The role of diet and exercise, investigative and treatment modalities, co-moribd conditions, and acute and chronic diabetes-related complications are other topics that have been discussed. The authors are well-known specialists in the field of diabetes.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Arvind S. Godbole \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9788179916551 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 246\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44454213419161,"sku":"2RC9788179916551","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/0648fff9d8d061aa7a938e4d995cc050.jpg?v=1717492613","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/full-life-with-diabetes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}